{"task":"design","reading":{"objective":"Announce a two-day technology conference on open infrastructure and drive ticket sales.","audience":"Engineers, platform and network people, open-source maintainers, policy and public-sector tech.","feeling":"Engineered, transparent, civic; confident rather than flashy."},"concept":{"idea":"A modular infrastructure drawing: a visible grid of blocks, some solid, some left empty, so the structure is exposed and open the way open systems are, set above a monumental headline.","decisions":["read first: the huge stacked headline 'Open Systems 2027', with 2027 in signal orange","type: Archivo at heavy weight, tight tracking, for an industrial grotesk voice; small Geist Mono-like precision from IBM Plex Mono for details","colour: warm concrete ground, near-black ink, one signal orange accent used for 2027, one module and the ticket bar","composition: drawing on top, headline anchored low-left, a hairline rule, then subhead left and details right on shared edges","forms: a 6 by 3 module grid with a few filled blocks; the gaps are the point, they read as open connections"]},"direction":{"name":"Exposed Grid","palette":{"ground":"#e9e7e0","ink":"#121413","accent":"#ff4a1c","accent2":null,"muted":"#a9a79e"},"display":"Archivo","body":"IBM Plex Mono"},"program":{"ground":"ground","elements":[{"op":"prim","kind":"grid","params":{"cols":6,"rows":3},"box":{"x":50,"y":110,"w":900,"h":450},"fill":null,"stroke":{"color":"muted","width":2},"name":"module grid","decorative":true},{"op":"rect","box":{"x":50,"y":410,"w":150,"h":150},"fill":"ink","name":"block a","decorative":true},{"op":"rect","box":{"x":200,"y":410,"w":150,"h":150},"fill":"ink","name":"block b","decorative":true},{"op":"rect","box":{"x":200,"y":260,"w":150,"h":150},"fill":"ink","name":"block c","decorative":true},{"op":"rect","box":{"x":500,"y":260,"w":150,"h":150},"fill":"accent","name":"accent module","decorative":true},{"op":"rect","box":{"x":650,"y":410,"w":150,"h":150},"fill